    - target: {fileID: 8053858591361123635, guid: 5d1623387756b224fa0dcb0162e8a627, type: 3}
      propertyPath: BacteriaRed.pictureObj
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 220941004}
    - target: {fileID: 8053858591361123635, guid: 5d1623387756b224fa0dcb0162e8a627, type: 3}
      propertyPath: BacteriaBlue.pictureObj
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1982791933}
    - target: {fileID: 8053858591361123635, guid: 5d1623387756b224fa0dcb0162e8a627, type: 3}
      propertyPath: BacteriaPink.pictureObj
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 764583929}
    - target: {fileID: 8053858591361123635, guid: 5d1623387756b224fa0dcb0162e8a627, type: 3}
      propertyPath: BacteriaRed.description
      value: "Moraxella catarrhalis appears in the game as an opportunistic enemy
        hiding in the upper airways. It remains quiet and unnoticed, blending into
        its surroundings while waiting for the host\u2019s defenses to weaken. When
        the moment comes, it turns aggressive and spreads through the sinuses, ears,
        and lungs. This enemy causes persistent inflammation that clogs passages
        and slows recovery. Moraxella catarrhalis teaches players that threats which
        seem harmless can become dangerous when vigilance fades."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8053858591361123635, guid: 5d1623387756b224fa0dcb0162e8a627, type: 3}
      propertyPath: BacteriaBlue.description
      value: Haemophilus influenzae appears in the game as a cunning enemy that exploits
        crowded airways and weakened defenses. It moves quickly through the respiratory
        passages, causing swelling and obstruction. Once established, it can trigger
        a chain of infections spreading toward the lungs. Subtle but dangerous, it
        strikes early and quietly. Haemophilus influenzae teaches players that ignoring
        small threats can shape the entire battle.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8053858591361123635, guid: 5d1623387756b224fa0dcb0162e8a627, type: 3}
      propertyPath: BacteriaGreen.pictureObj
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 933381393}
    - target: {fileID: 8053858591361123635, guid: 5d1623387756b224fa0dcb0162e8a627, type: 3}
      propertyPath: BacteriaPink.description
      value: Escherichia coli is introduced in the game as a deceptive enemy that
        normally exists in balance but turns dangerous when it crosses forbidden
        boundaries. Once it escapes its usual territory, it unleashes powerful toxins
        that disrupt vital systems, causing chaos and rapid damage from within. This
        enemy spreads quickly through contaminated paths, overwhelming defenses before
        they can fully respond. Unpredictable and versatile, Escherichia coli symbolizes
        how familiar forces can become deadly threats when order is broken and control
        is lost.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8053858591361123635, guid: 5d1623387756b224fa0dcb0162e8a627, type: 3}
      propertyPath: BacteriaGreen.description
      value: Pseudomonas aeruginosa appears in the game as a ruthless and highly
        adaptable enemy that thrives in harsh environments. It spreads through wounds
        and weakened systems, forming resilient colonies that are hard to eliminate.
        This pathogen releases toxic substances that slowly overwhelm defenses. Resistant
        and persistent, it refuses to retreat once established. Pseudomonas aeruginosa
        represents a dangerous late-game threat that punishes careless strategy.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8053858591361123635, guid: 5d1623387756b224fa0dcb0162e8a627, type: 3}
      propertyPath: BacteriaOrange.pictureObj
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1214144675}
    - target: {fileID: 8053858591361123635, guid: 5d1623387756b224fa0dcb0162e8a627, type: 3}
      propertyPath: BacteriaPurple.pictureObj
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 364701984}
    - target: {fileID: 8053858591361123635, guid: 5d1623387756b224fa0dcb0162e8a627, type: 3}
      propertyPath: BacteriaYellow.pictureObj
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 881602483}
    - target: {fileID: 8053858591361123635, guid: 5d1623387756b224fa0dcb0162e8a627, type: 3}
      propertyPath: BacteriaOrange.description
      value: Methicillin-Resistant Staphylococcus aureus (MRSA) appears in the game
        as a hardened elite enemy shaped by countless failed attempts to destroy
        it. It resists conventional attacks and adapts rapidly to incoming threats.
        Entering through wounds and close contact, it builds fortified strongholds
        that are difficult to break. Relentless and unforgiving, MRSA tests both
        strategy and patience. It represents the danger of enemies forged through
        resistance.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8053858591361123635, guid: 5d1623387756b224fa0dcb0162e8a627, type: 3}
      propertyPath: BacteriaPurple.description
      value: "Streptococcus pneumonia is known in the game world as a silent invader
        that strikes when defenses grow weak. It drifts through the air unnoticed,
        settling deep within the lungs where it multiplies rapidly and clouds the
        battlefield with infection. Once ignored, it spreads beyond its first foothold,
        triggering fever, breathlessness, and confusion as it drains the host\u2019s
        strength from within. Clever and resilient, this enemy thrives on vulnerability,
        turning a moment of neglect into a full-scale assault, reminding players
        that even the smallest unseen foe can become a devastating threat if left
        unchecked."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8053858591361123635, guid: 5d1623387756b224fa0dcb0162e8a627, type: 3}
      propertyPath: BacteriaYellow.description
      value: Staphylococcus aureus appears in the game as a versatile and aggressive
        enemy that exploits close contact and exposed weaknesses. It enters through
        small wounds, multiplies rapidly, and releases damaging toxins. Though it
        seems manageable at first, it can quickly escalate into severe infections
        if ignored. Adaptable and relentless, it overwhelms the battlefield with
        pressure. Staphylococcus aureus teaches players not to underestimate common
        enemies.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8073782142175667681, guid: 5d1623387756b224fa0dcb0162e8a627, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_OnClick.m_PersistentCalls.m_Calls.Array.data[0].m_Target
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 531181774}
    - target: {fileID: 8073782142175667681, guid: 5d1623387756b224fa0dcb0162e8a627, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_OnClick.m_PersistentCalls.m_Calls.Array.data[0].m_MethodName
